{"unit_id":"VanlxyG__dsh-hover-sidebar#card-zh","repo":"VanlxyG/dsh-hover-sidebar","commit":"7217983f037125bd55e084dd4c916095ccfea3b1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-sidebar 是面向 DSH 网页和桌面客户端的侧边栏交互插件，通过悬停自动展开左侧栏，并在鼠标离开后自动收起。它注入宿主公开的 layout 服务，调用侧栏切换动作，并根据鼠标位置、手动开合状态和交互状态决定何时展开或收起。主要功能包括桌面边缘和 Web 图标栏热区触发展开、离开延迟收起、手动打开后固定、输入和菜单交互时保持展开，以及按 Escape 收起临时面板。适合希望减少侧栏占用并快速访问 DSH 左侧栏的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务；可选调节参数保存在当前浏览器来源的本地存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:8-16","client.js:263-289","client.js:323-350","client.js:352-363"]}
{"unit_id":"VanlxyG__dsh-hover-sidebar#card-en","repo":"VanlxyG/dsh-hover-sidebar","commit":"7217983f037125bd55e084dd4c916095ccfea3b1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hover-sidebar reveals the DSH web or desktop sidebar when the pointer reaches its edge, then hides it after leaving. Manual opens stay pinned; editing and menus pause closing, and Escape dismisses temporary opens. Hover delays and animation are adjustable. No API key or external service needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:8-16","client.js:263-289","client.js:323-350","client.js:352-363"]}
